| `minimal-diff` | Bloated diff / over-engineering pass (readonly) |

## Slash commands (`.cursor/commands/`)

`/validate` · `/deploy-check` · `/smoke-ui` · `/seo-audit` · `/i18n-sync` · `/umb` · `/graphify` · `/minimal-diff`

Skills for Customize UI live in `.cursor/skills/` (synced from `.agents/skills` via `npm run cursor:customize`; D: is exFAT so copies, not junctions).

## Session isolation

Always-on rule: `.cursor/rules/session-isolation.mdc`. Parallel Agents → Worktree / `/worktree` / `/isolate`. Playwright MCP uses `--isolated` (no shared browser context). Hook blocks `git reset --hard` / `clean -f` / force-push.

## Cloud agents

No hello-world site tour. No PR/branches unless the task or user explicitly requires them. Secrets only in Dashboard, never in git.


## Marketplace policy (claude-plugins-official)

Do **not** install stack-mismatched Marketplace plugins (LSPs for PHP/Ruby/Rust/Swift/Python, Terraform, Telegram, Serena, ralph-loop, playground, session-report, mcp-tunnels, plugin-dev, Datadog).

| Need | Use instead |
| --- | --- |
| Browser QA | Project Playwright MCP `:8931` (not Marketplace playwright) |
| Security review | Rule `security-site` + `/review-security` + hooks `block-secrets` |
| PR quality | `/review-bugbot` + `minimal-diff` + GitHub MCP |
| Skills authoring | Cursor `create-skill` + `.agents/skills` → `npm run cursor:customize` |
| Code map | Graphify `:8932` |

Allowlist (cursor-public): **figma**, **linear**, **notion-workspace**, **zapier**. Audit: `npm run cursor:customize`.
